abstract: >-
  An institutional-grade open-source quantitative sovereign risk and macroeconomic
  market intelligence platform implemented in TypeScript. Unifies a 6-Layer Sovereign
  Default & Tail-Risk Pipeline (Logistic EWS, Bayesian Log-Odds Updating, Merton
  Structural Balance Sheet, Gaussian HMM Regime Switching, POT/GPD Extreme Value
  Theory VaR/ES, and Legal/CAC LGD) with a 7-Pillar Forensic Vulnerability Scorecard,
  Nelson-Siegel Sovereign Yield Curve & Debt Maturity Wall Analyzer, 3-Round DebtRank
  Systemic Contagion Simulator, Open-Economy Augmented Taylor Rule Monitor, Student-t
  Copula Euler Portfolio VaR & CDS Hedge Optimizer, and Basel III FRTB Backtesting.
